# What every binary under third_party/ must hash to.
#
# Checked by tools/verify_third_party.sh, and by tools/fetch_pdfium.sh after
# each download — a PDFium that does not match is deleted, not loaded. The
# PDFium lines are for release chromium/7881 of bblanchon/pdfium-binaries;
# moving the pin means re-deriving them from the release's own assets and
# changing them here on purpose, in the same commit.
#
# Format: sha256sum / shasum -a 256, paths relative to this directory.
